})();</script></div></div></div><div class="KLEmSd"></div><div data-encoded-docid="7HRnlZdTv8Pfm7xhAAAAAA==" data-implicit-notification-eligible="false" data-result-index="0" data-title="Data Analyst Job ID: 424698" role="group" jscontroller="leJiCf" jsdata="ZSBYQe;_;lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ60 xQKg9c;_;lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ65" jsaction="rcuQ6b:npT2md"><div><div class="XFOJCe"><h2 class="HKvozf IFnjPb">Job description</h2><span jsname="QAWWu" class="OOyDTc">About the Role<br><br>Data Analyst 2 to 5 years Full Time We are hiring a sharp, analytically rigorous Data Analyst who thrives at the intersection of data engineering, automation, and business storytelling. This is not a pure reporting role. You will architect automated data pipelines, build scalable reporting workflows, and bring a growth marketing mindset to every analysis. If you love turning messy </span><span jsname="pqRzIf">...</span><span jsname="ij8cu" class="ejCXj" id="tsuid_lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ_188" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">data into clear decisions, this is your seat.<br>Key Responsibilities<br>• SQL and Data Infrastructure<br>• Design and maintain complex, high-performance SQL queries across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and MongoDB that power daily business decisions.<br>• Build and own data models that structure raw datasets into clean, analytics ready layers for BI tools and downstream teams.<br>• Spot data gaps, anomalies, and inconsistencies proactively and work closely with engineering to resolve them before they become business problems.<br>• Automation and Pipeline Engineering<br>• Build automated reporting workflows that push query outputs directly into Google Sheets, dashboards, or BI tools with minimal manual intervention.<br>• Own end to end data delivery from raw query to polished dashboard ensuring real time visibility into business metrics across teams.<br>• AI and Smart Automation<br>• Use AI tools thoughtfully to automate insight generation, summarize data trends, and reduce repetitive analytical tasks.<br>• Explore automation workflows to surface insights faster and reduce analyst bottlenecks across teams.<br>• Apply AI assisted scripting to scheduled or event driven reporting tasks where they add genuine value.<br>• Marketing and Growth Analytics<br>• Track multi channel campaign performance across paid, organic, and owned channels measuring ROI, attribution, and incremental impact.<br>• Analyze audience behavior, funnel drop offs, and conversion patterns to surface actionable growth insights for the marketing team.<br>• Support A/B tests, cohort experiments, and growth initiatives defining metrics, setting up tracking, and delivering clear post analysis readouts.<br>• Build and maintain marketing dashboards that give the growth team real time visibility into campaign and channel health.<br>• Cross Functional Insight Delivery<br>• Partner with Operations, Finance, Product, and Marketing to translate open ended business questions into reliable, reproducible analyses.<br>• Own ad hoc and recurring analysis including cohort studies, funnel health, retention trends, LTV modeling, and operational KPIs.<br>• Communicate findings clearly and concisely, tailored to the audience whether that is a 5 slide exec summary or a detailed breakdown for a product team.<br>Must Have Skills<br>• Advanced SQL proficiency across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and similar databases including window functions, CTEs, query optimization, and schema design.<br>• Strong experience automating data workflows pushing query outputs to Google Sheets, dashboards, or downstream tools with minimal manual effort.<br>• Experience with scheduled and event driven data processing using orchestration tools.<br>• Solid understanding of data modeling and structuring datasets for analytics consumption.<br>• Comfortable navigating large, messy, and ambiguous datasets to answer open ended business questions.<br>• Proficient in Excel and one or more BI tools such as Metabase, Power BI, Tableau, or Looker<br>• Strong grasp of business KPIs and ability to derive and communicate insights from raw data with minimal hand holding. Familiarity with AI assisted tools and willingness to use them as a real productivity lever in analytical workflows.</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ_188" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCsQRg" data-ved="2ahUKEwjnv8uh0YiYAxULleEIHeZbJ0QQl5ACegQIKxBG"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjnv8uh0YiYAxULleEIHeZbJ0QQ5ZkFegQIKxBH"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjnv8uh0YiYAxULleEIHeZbJ0QQyo8CegQIKxBI"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Rentomojo Limited&#39;,job_title:&#39;Data Analyst Job ID: 424698&#39;})","_lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ_201",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jobs",[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["share_link","https://www.google.com/search?q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026hl\u003den\u0026ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026udm\u003d8"],["jobs_posting_urls_1","https://www.jobleads.com/in/job/data-analyst-job-id-424698--bengaluru--ecf015a94aaa8099e5cc20b9a1a1dd347?utm_campaign\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_source\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026u