alizations and reports\n Collaborate with other members of the team to ensure that the data is accurate, complete, and reliable\n Communicate findings and recommendations to the team and stakeholders\n Work with the USA team and overlap shifts to ensure effective communication and collaboration\n Keep up-to-date with emerging data analysis tools, techniques, and trends\n\nRequirements\n\n Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Data Science, or a related field\n 3+ years of experience in data analysis, data profiling, and data investigation\n Advanced skills in SQL and Tableau\n Experience with other BI tools is a plus\n Excellent written and oral communication skills\n Ability to work collaboratively with a team and independently\n Experience documenting traceability matrix and source to target mapping documentation for Data Integration projects\n Solid analytical and problem-solving skills\n Familiarity with Agile methodologies\n Must be able to work effectively with the USA team and overlapping shifts.\n\nNotes\n\nJoining time should not be longer than 15 days. .","Data Analyst With Advanced Tableau Bengaluru (India)",null,null,0,[["organization","Technix India Solutions"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x6dfc971fa6d91f40"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ64":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.7693108,4]]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ79":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dHXjGK2PjIi9QjnnCAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_0WOMYrCUBBAsc0RrKZ0F8kXwcatFEFErA