owerPoint for cross-functional teams.Candidate RequirementsCore Technical SkillsExperience: 5 to 8+ years of professional experience in a data analysis, business intelligence, or data-driven role.Programming \u0026amp; Databases: Solid foundation in Python and SQL / Google SQL for data extraction, manipulation, and pipeline creation.Google Ecosystem \u0026amp; AI Tooling: Hands-on experience with Google Sheets, Looker Studio, Gemini models, and LLM APIs, alongside workflow automation via JavaScript / Google Apps Script.Modern Frameworks: Familiarity with Model Context Protocol (MCP) standards for dynamic context sharing and tool orchestration.BI \u0026amp; Visualization: Expertise in data visualization platforms like Tableau, Power BI, or Looker Studio.Soft Skills \u0026amp; MindsetAnalytical Thinking: Naturally curious with high attention to detail and a passion for independent problem-solving.Communication: Excellent verbal and written communication skills to convey findings effectively to technical and non-technical stakeholders.","Senior Data Analyst - AI \u0026 Automation",null,null,0,[["organization","QualityAI"],["organization_mid","/g/11z9bl2kx1"],["publisher_name","LinkedIn"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x8a9dc6aa73142695"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ66":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.21147288,4]]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ78":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dT-eetaF-4AL6IxetAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xWOMQrCQBBFsc0RrMbGQjQrgo2CEBFErMQDhElYNtHNTNiZha