A%3D%3D",null,null,"Senior Analyst, Advanced Analytics",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_yWLMQ6CQBAAY8sTbNzaEM6Y2EiFjYV2PoAsx-ZAj93L7WGw8w-W_s6XiLGZYjKTvRdZeSHuJULF6B-acqjaO7Kl9m9SbxU-zxdcpQEljLYDYTiKOE_Lsksp6N4YVV84TTjnhZXBCFMjk5kn_aHWDiMFj4nq7W4zFYHdenXGxkoM0DMciB36MY45nDAyJrzhF73oS7ieAAAA","v1_Ac3VAozbrb0WP0n_sJXlnAj5gHPmgSekGD-Y-XiGcMT508-vOA"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ70":[[0,"https://careers.labcorp.com/senior-analyst-advanced-analytics/job/2629065","jobs","rXDPBb77rotzBM","\u003cdiv class\u003d'description'\u003e\u003ch1\u003eSr. Analyst, Advanced Analytics\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eLocation:\u003c/b\u003e Bangalore or Mumbai, India\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eFunction:\u003c/b\u003e Marketing \u0026 Commercial Analytics\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eExperience:\u003c/b\u003e 5+ years\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eEmployment Type:\u003c/b\u003e Full-time\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAbout the Role\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eLabcorp is hiring a \u003cb\u003eSenior Data Analyst\u003c/b\u003e to join the Marketing team and help augment its capability in Market, Product, and Customer Analytics to further the utility of data assets towards business insight. This role will be an integral member of a team that is responsible for data-driven insights to inform marketing strategies, answer business questions, and help Labcorp better serve our customers.  This role is designed for the \u003cb\u003eAI-augmented workforce of the future\u003c/b\u003e, where human judgment, business context, and decision ownership are amplified by modern analytics and AI tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis is not a traditional reporting or MIS role. You will work closely with marketing and commercial leaders to shape decisions related to customer growth, marketing effectiveness, and investment prioritization-using advanced analytics, experimentation, and automation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe ideal candidate combines strong analytical fundamentals, business acumen, and the ability to leverage AI as a productivity and insight multiplier, while remaining accountable for interpretation, validation, and recommendations. We’re looking for someone who blends strategic thinking, strong data skills, and clear marketing communication—and who can use AI to meaningfully amplify impact.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat You Will Do\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBusiness-Driven Analytics \u0026 Decision Support\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with marketing and commercial stakeholders to translate business questions into structured analytical problems\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIdentify where analytics and AI can meaningfully improve decision-making (not just reporting)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFull program responsibilities: partnering with stakeholders to identify key issues, define the problem, run the required analysis, and translate findings into clear recommendations.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAI-Enabled Analytics Support (Preferred / Nice to Have)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse AI-assisted workflows to speed up data preparation, exploration, and quality checks to support visualization and reporting needs\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eProvide occasional supporting analysis (primarily descriptive/diagnostic; predictive/causal is a plus) to add context to dashboards and stakeholder questions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLeverage AI tools responsibly for:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eFaster data exploration and pattern detection\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eQuery/code assistance\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDrafting chart narratives or dashboard commentary (with human review)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHuman judgment remains central; you are accountable for accuracy and appropriate interpretation of outputs\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eExperimentation \u0026 Measurement\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eDesign and analyze A/B and multivariate experiments to measure marketing effectiveness\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply causal thinking to quantify incremental impact and ROI\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHelp teams understand what is truly driving performance versus correlation or noise\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDashboards, Automation \u0026 Insight Products\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eDesign decision-oriented dashboards and performance views for business users\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAutomate recurring analyses to reduce manual effort and increase consistency\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuild reusable analytics assets rather than one-off analyses, where possible\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCollaboration \u0026 Data Stewardship\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWork closely with data engineering, platform, and governance teams to ensure data reliability and usability\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply appropriate data privacy, compliance, and quality standards in all analyses\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAct as a thought partner to stakeholders, not a ticket-taker\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRequired Qualifications\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBachelor’s degree in quantitative field (Data Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, Engineering, or related discipline)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eA minimum of 5 years of experience in analytics supporting business decisions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong hands-on experience with:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eSQL and querying large, complex datasets. PySpark experience is preferred.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eData analysis and statistical reasoning\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBusiness-facing dashboards and visualizations (Power BI, Tableau)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\u003eo\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCore Skills \u0026 Capabilities\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAnalytics \u0026 Technical Skills\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAdvanced SQL and experience working with enterprise data warehouses\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eProficiency in Python or R for analysis and modeling\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience designing and interpreting experiments (A/B testing)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAbility to work with imperfect, real-world data and still deliver actionable insights\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAI Readiness (Practical, Not Hype-Driven)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eHands-on experience using AI tools to augment analytics work (e.g., code acceleration, data exploration, insight summarization)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFamiliarity with Generative AI workflows (e.g., using LLMs for automated sentiment analysis or data normalization)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong judgment on when AI outputs can be trusted vs when deeper validation is required\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCuriosity and continuous-learning mindset toward emerging analytics and AI\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003e(Deep machine learning engineering is not required.)\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBusiness \u0026 Communication Skills\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAbility to translate ambiguous business problems into structured analytics\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong data storytelling skills connecting insights to decisions and actions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eConfidence working with senior stakeholders in both arriving at an understanding of what problem they are trying to solve, and communicating the answers in the medium that resonates with them\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBias toward action and measurable business impact\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePreferred Qualifications\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience in healthcare, life sciences, or other adjacent industries\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience with cloud analytics platforms such as Databricks or Snowflake and tools such as PySpark\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFamiliarity with data privacy and governance concepts (HIPAA, GDPR)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience building reusable dashboards or analytics products\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience creating compelling storyboards\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy Join Labcorp in this role\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWork on high-impact commercial and marketing decisions at enterprise scale\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBe part of an analytics team redefining how \u003cb\u003eAI and human judgment work together\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMove beyond reporting into \u003cb\u003etrue decision intelligence\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuild skills that remain relevant as analytics and AI continue to evolve\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eLabcorp is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Labcorp strives for inclusion and belonging in the workforce and does not tolerate harassment or discrimination of any kind. We make employment decisions based on the needs of our business and the qualifications and merit of the individual. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), family or parental status, marital, civil union or domestic partnership status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, personal appearance, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or any other legally protected characteristic. Additionally, all qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment in accordance with applicable law.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e \u003cb\u003eWe encourage all to apply\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e If you are an individual with a disability who needs assistance using our online tools to search and apply for jobs, or needs an accommodation, please visit our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://careers.labcorp.com/global/en/accessibility\"\u003eaccessibility site\u003c/a\u003e or contact us at \u003ca href\u003d\"mailto:Disability_apply@LabCorp.com\"\u003eLabcorp Accessibility\u003c/a\u003e. For more information about how we collect and store your personal data, please see our \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.labcorp.com/compliance/privacy/privacy-notice\"\u003ePrivacy Statement\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","Senior Analyst, Advanced Analytics",null,null,0,[["organization","Labcorp"],["organization_mid","/m/03p2jcg"],["publisher_name","Labcorp Careers"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0xdbf07d89c090baf8"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ71":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.018712023,4]]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ80":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003di677vgXPcK2VpxydAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_yWLMQ6CQBAAY8sTbNzaEM6Y2EiFjYV2PoAsx-ZAj93L7WGw8w-W_s6XiLGZYjKTvRdZeSHuJULF6B-acqjaO7Kl9m9SbxU-zxdcpQEljLYDYTiKOE_Lsksp6N4YVV84TTjnhZXBCFMjk5kn_aHWDiMFj4nq7W4zFYHdenXGxkoM0DMciB36MY45nDAyJrzhF73oS7ieAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAozbrb0WP0n_sJXlnAj5gHPmgSekGD-Y-XiGcMT508-vOA\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djo