esponsibilities\u003c/h3\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eSQL and Data Infrastructure\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eDesign and maintain complex, high-performance SQL queries across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and MongoDB that power daily business decisions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuild and own data models that structure raw datasets into clean, analytics ready layers for BI tools and downstream teams.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpot data gaps, anomalies, and inconsistencies proactively and work closely with engineering to resolve them before they become business problems.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eAutomation and Pipeline Engineering\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuild automated reporting workflows that push query outputs directly into Google Sheets, dashboards, or BI tools with minimal manual intervention.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eOwn end to end data delivery from raw query to polished dashboard ensuring real time visibility into business metrics across teams.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eAI and Smart Automation\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse AI tools thoughtfully to automate insight generation, summarize data trends, and reduce repetitive analytical tasks.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eExplore automation workflows to surface insights faster and reduce analyst bottlenecks across teams.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eApply AI assisted scripting to scheduled or event driven reporting tasks where they add genuine value.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eMarketing and Growth Analytics\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eTrack multi channel campaign performance across paid, organic, and owned channels measuring ROI, attribution, and incremental impact.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnalyze audience behavior, funnel drop offs, and conversion patterns to surface actionable growth insights for the marketing team.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport A/B tests, cohort experiments, and growth initiatives defining metrics, setting up tracking, and delivering clear post analysis readouts.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuild and maintain marketing dashboards that give the growth team real time visibility into campaign and channel health.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003eCross Functional Insight Delivery\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with Operations, Finance, Product, and Marketing to translate open ended business questions into reliable, reproducible analyses.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eOwn ad hoc and recurring analysis including cohort studies, funnel health, retention trends, LTV modeling, and operational KPIs.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eCommunicate findings clearly and concisely, tailored to the audience whether that is a 5 slide exec summary or a detailed breakdown for a product team.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMust Have Skills\u003c/h3\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eAdvanced SQL proficiency across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and similar databases including window functions, CTEs, query optimization, and schema design.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong experience automating data workflows pushing query outputs to Google Sheets, dashboards, or downstream tools with minimal manual effort.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience with scheduled and event driven data processing using orchestration tools.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eSolid understanding of data modeling and structuring datasets for analytics consumption.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eComfortable navigating large, messy, and ambiguous datasets to answer open ended business questions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eProficient in Excel and one or more BI tools such as Metabase, Power BI, Tableau, or Looker\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong grasp of business KPIs and ability to derive and communicate insights from raw data with minimal hand holding. Familiarity with AI assisted tools and willingness to use them as a real productivity lever in analytical workflows.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","Data Analyst Job ID: 424698",null,null,0,[["organization","Rentomojo Limited"],["organization_mid","/g/11f01538zl"],["publisher_name","JobLeads"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x03ab6fdd051ffc52"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ65":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.6011071,4]]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ73":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003d7HRnlZdTv8Pfm7xhAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xWOOwrCQBBAsc0RrKZVJCshisZKCYifyguESVw2Gzc7YWcCsfMO9h7OkxibVzx48KLPJEpzFIS9R_dkgTOVcMozSJN0vd3A9_WGZlSsMVQ1kIcjkXF6uqtFOs6UYnaxYUGxVVxRq8jrkgY1RvxHwTUG3TkUXSSr5RB33sxnN-2FWmoIrra1ou9gPRy0N-j60C_ggsGPVw_8AXsiTmShAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAowVvNLJEid73ktEiyLho1Ea4Ov02dEgQFx19On4VASdMA\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003d7HRnlZdTv8Pfm7xhAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026htiq\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs",null,null,"Data Analyst Job ID: 424698",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_xWOOwrCQBBAsc0RrKZVJCshisZKCYifyguESVw2Gzc7YWcCsfMO9