 through cross-functional learning, encouraged and applauded at 7-Eleven GSC. With our size, stability, and resources, you can navigate a rewarding career. Embody leadership and service as 7-Eleven GSC remains dedicated to meeting the needs of customers and communities. Why We Exist, Our Purpose and Our Transformation? 7-Eleven is dedicated to being a customer-centric, digitally empowered organization that seamlessly integrates our physical stores with digital offerings. Our goal is to redefine convenience by consistently providing top-notch customer experiences and solutions in a rapidly evolving consumer landscape. Anticipating customer preferences, we create and implement platforms that empower customers to shop, pay, and access products and services according to their preferences. To achieve success, we are driving a cultural shift anchored in leadership principles, supported by the realignment of organizational resources and processes. At 7-Eleven we are guided by our Leadership Principles. Each principle has a defined set of behaviours which help guide the 7-Eleven GSC team to Serve Customers and Support Stores. 1. Be Customer Obsessed 2. Be Courageous with Your Point of View 3. Challenge the Status Quo 4. Act Like an Entrepreneur 5. Have an “It Can Be Done” Attitude 6. Do the Right Thing 7. Be Accountable Job Title : Data Analyst Role Summary The Analyst, Private Brands Analytics, supports data-driven decision-making for 7-Eleven's Private Brands business. This role is critical in building \u0026 maintaining accurate reporting solutions, validating data, and delivering baseline insights to help drive growth, profitability, and operational excellence across the Private Brands portfolio. Key Responsibilities Develop, maintain, and enhance standardized dashboards and reports measuring key Private Brands performance metrics, including sales, margin, inventory, promotions, assortment, and market share Ensure high-quality, accurate, and timely delivery of recurring reports and ad-hoc requests Support analyses, business updates, and executive presentations through data gathering, analysis, and insight generation Monitor key business performance indicators and proactively highlight risks, opportunities, and emerging trends impacting Private Brands performance Identify reporting automation and process improvement opportunities to enhance efficiency and reduce manual effort Maintain and improve data sources, trackers, and automation tools to drive efficiency Qualifications \u0026 Skills 1-3 years of experience in Analytics, Business Intelligence, Merchandising Analytics, Category Management, Retail Analytics, or related functions Strong proficiency in SQL and Excel, with experience using visualization tools such as Power BI or Tableau. Exposure to Databricks and Python is preferred Experience analyzing large datasets and translating findings into clear business insights Understanding of retail KPIs such as sales, margin, inventory, promotions, assortment, and customer purchasing behavior Familiarity with data warehousing platforms, cloud-based analytics environments, or modern reporting tools is a plus Key Attributes Strong analytical and problem-solving mindset with exceptional attention to detail Ability to synthesize complex data into clear, concise, and actionable insights Self-motivated, organized, and able to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment Continuous improvement mindset with a passion for leveraging data to drive business outcomes Curiosity to learn the retail business model and eagerness to grow in analytics PrPrivileges \u0026 Perquisites: 7-Eleven Global Solution Center offers a comprehensive benefits plan tailored to meet the needs and improve the overall experience of our employees, aiding in the management of both their professional and personal aspects. Work-Life Balance: Encouraging employees to unwind, recharge, and find balance, we offer flexible and hybrid work schedules along with diverse leave options. Supplementary allowances and compensatory days off are provided for specific work demands. Well-Being \u0026 Family Protection: Comprehensive medical coverage for spouses, children, and parents/in-laws, with voluntary top-up plans, OPD coverage, day care services, and access to health coaches. Additionally, an Employee Assistance Program with free, unbiased and confidential expert consultations for personal and professional issues. Top of Form Wheels and Meals: Free transportation and cafeteria facilities with diverse menu options including breakfast, lunch, snacks, and beverages, customizable and health-conscious choices. Certification \u0026 Training Program: Sponsored training for specialized certifications. Investment in employee development through labs and learning platforms. Hassel free Relocation: Support and reimbursement for newly hired employees relocating to Bangalore, India.","Data Analyst - Private Brand",null,null,0,[["organization","7-Eleven"],["organization_mid","/m/0crk6"],["publisher_name","Jobaaj"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x5328e417840e9abf"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ52":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.45894158,4]]],"lPH4auelCYuqhvcP5redoQQ68":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dSMmRjF_eyUg6WW0PAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xWOMQrCQBAAsc0TrLYWkxMhCFoZFAsbfxA2cblEz91wuwmx8w-CD_Qlxma6GSb5zJL8gIawZwxPNUjhEtsBjaCIyFf4vt5wkwqUMNYNCMNJxAea7xqzTrfOqYbMq6G1dVbLwwlTJaObJP2j1AYjdWFKlut8NWYd-wVs0mOggRhahoLYY-hjv4QzRp5u7vgDTUckiZkAAAA\